Package: markflow
Version: 0.2.0
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0
Maintainer: TopHermDev <noreply@github.com>
Description: Lightweight markdown reader and editor
 A fast, minimal markdown editor built with Tauri 2.
 Supports GitHub Flavored Markdown, dark/light theme,
 and keyboard shortcuts for preview/editing.
Homepage: https://github.com/TopHermDev/markdown-editor
